Happy early birthday to your husband!

**Availability:** There is space on the Warehouse tasting tour on Friday 11 September. It runs at 14:30 and has 11 places left, so there is plenty of room for the two of you. It is for ages 18 and over.

**Accessibility:** The shop, cafe and still house all have step-free access and a lift. The warehouse floor, however, is uneven, and the warehouse is where the tasting tour takes place. I don't have details on how the tour handles wheelchair users, so I can't say how well it would work for him. It would be worth checking with the visitor centre before you book, particularly if he plans to use his wheelchair that day.

**Parking:** There is free parking for cars beside the visitor centre. I don't have details of specific accessible bays or how close they are to the entrance, so the visitor centre team can confirm that for you too.

If it would help, the 11:00 Classic tour also has 4 places. I don't have information on its route, so I can't say whether it would suit him better.
